			htmlDescription: `<p>Do you want to populate the spellbook for this class (for class level${deltaLevels === 1 ? "" : "s"} ${deltaLevels === 1 ? dataBuilderOpts.targetLevel : `${curLevel + 1}-${dataBuilderOpts.targetLevel}`})?</p>`,
